45
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:26.333
The NIST AI Risk Management Framework
organizes work around governing,

46
00:04:26.333 --> 00:04:32.667
mapping, measuring, and managing risk. A
release gate makes those

47
00:04:32.667 --> 00:04:39.000
responsibilities concrete: evidence
informs the decision, while authorized

48
00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:45.333
