verification, readiness, warm-up, routing,

89
00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:21.667
and postcondition checks as an update.
During reversal, stop candidate

90
00:10:21.667 --> 00:10:28.533
admission, drain or reconcile bounded
in-flight work, restore the complete

91
00:10:28.533 --> 00:10:35.400
baseline, and verify exact identity,
representative quality, endpoint contract,

92
00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:42.267
authorization, queue state, telemetry,
cost, and user-visible recovery. Changing

93
00:10:42.267 --> 00:10:49.133
an alias to old weights while leaving a
