100
00:11:29.077 --> 00:11:35.692
Feed release and rollback findings back
into evaluation cases, thresholds,

101
00:11:35.692 --> 00:11:42.308
capacity assumptions, compatibility
manifests, state-migration tests, and

102
00:11:42.308 --> 00:11:48.923
runbooks. Retain rejected candidates under
