105
00:12:02.154 --> 00:12:08.769
expires: when infrastructure, traffic,
policy, data, grader, or dependency

106
00:12:08.769 --> 00:12:15.385
conditions change, rerun the affected
gates rather than treating an

107
00:12:15.385 --> 00:12:22.000
